        {
            "block_label": "abstract",
            "block_content": "(1) Recognition of Union – The Company agrees to recognize the Union as the sole collective bargaining agency for all of its employees classified under the Classification of Work and Wages, forming a part hereof, in the Customer Service Department. Distribution Operations, Meter Reading, Metering, Property Operation and Maintenance, Property Maintenance Operations, Field Service Operations, Stock and Transportation Departments or Divisions of its Detroit District, for the purpose of deciding any disputes which may arise concerning wage rates, working conditions, hours, dismissals or discriminations. All of the aforementioned departments and divisions are hereinafter called and referred to as \"departments\" in this Collective Bargaining Agreement.",
            "block_bbox": [
                53,
                127,
                633,
                371
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
